1
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:06,390
 Wake up.

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,810
HEY! LET ME GO- WHAT THE FUCK IS THIS?

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,980
Go on.

4
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:18,230
Out of everyone who has laid on this table like you,

5
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:23,470
you're one special guy, you know that?

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,310
I mean, (laughs), the things you've done

7
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:32,670
have made you more deserving to end up here - than anyone else.

8
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,870
I'LL FUCKING KILL YOU.

9
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,220
Yes..

10
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:40,640
Death is no stranger to either of us.

11
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:46,850
We both use it as our own form of.. release.

12
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:53,060
And now its time - for YOUR release.

13
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:56,540
PLEASE.. YOU'VE GOT THE WRONG PERSON

14
00:00:56,740 --> 00:01:00,110
I HAVENT DONE ANYTHING - I'M INNOCENT!

15
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:03,090
Ha! Look at you go.

16
00:01:03,290 --> 00:01:06,550
You can't wiggle yourself out of this like you did

17
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:08,580
with the cops a few years back.

18
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,340
I know what you did to them,

19
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:14,260
JAMES.

20
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:17,440
I know you strung them up like sacks of meat.

21
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:21,520
I know you dug them a few shallow graves in your shitty

22
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:22,530
little backyard.

23
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:25,720
Now, it's your turn.

24
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,370
Goodnight, James.